{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9a37505b7daeb2e5","name":"The Ebon Strikers","source":{"id":"source:reference-9a37505b7daeb2e5","title":"The Ebon Strikers","revision":23475,"timestamp":"2024-09-28T23:59:56Z","sha256":"05f456868ca84166389c539fad0f7bdd914a19535ed6a48348c4e8a9ae44884c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=23475","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Ebon%20Strikers&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9a37505b7daeb2e5","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The other half of the pirate group that spawned ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Crimson Stars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Crimson_Stars","referenceId":"reference:35b92de82fa6ec43"},", The Ebon Strikers are led by the brother of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vallkos"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vallkos?action=edit&redlink=1"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mallikhan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mallikhan?action=edit&redlink=1"},". Whereas ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Crimson Stars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Crimson_Stars","referenceId":"reference:35b92de82fa6ec43"}," still do trade in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Outer Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"},", The Ebon Strikers tend to focus on action on and around ",{"tag":"a","children":["Volik"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Volik","referenceId":"reference:24aae6e1e2447b18"},". The Ebon Strikers also sometimes raid Crimson Star flotillas returning from ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Outer Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"},", causing brief skirmishes to break out in the space above ",{"tag":"a","children":["Volik"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Volik","referenceId":"reference:24aae6e1e2447b18"},". The Ebon Strikers have been secretly negotiating with another Unknown Regions power, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Vagaari Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Vagaari_Empire","referenceId":"reference:15aa603212aaa0f7"},", but ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mallikhan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mallikhan?action=edit&redlink=1"}," has no idea that his newfound allies are planning on betraying him before too long.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
